{"id": "holcim-2026-11-16-008", "date": "2026-11-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["holcim"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["capacity"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["涉及產能"]}, "title": "Holcim Egypt restarts fifth cement production line", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/HOLCIM_2021_7D_146-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Egypt:</strong> Holcim Egypt has recommissioned its fifth cement production line at its Ain Sokhna cement plant with an investment of US$24.2m, following a seven-year shutdown. The restarted line will reportedly create 560 direct and indirect jobs.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Industry Minister Khaled Hashem said that the government is encouraging cement producers to increase their use of alternative fuels (AF), ", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21494-holcim-egypt-restarts-fifth-cement-production-line", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "ultratech-2026-11-16-009", "date": "2026-11-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["ultratech"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["raw_material_energy_cost", "capacity"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["涉及產能"]}, "title": "UltraTech Cement hires Loesche for two clinker and slag grinding plants", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/india-flag-blue-sky.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>India:</strong> Loesche announced on 13 November 2026 that it had won contracts to supply clinker and slag grinding plants for UltraTech Cement’s Wanakbori plant in Gujarat and Dankuni plant in West Bengal. The Wanakbori plant will feature a vertical roller mill with a capacity of 180t/hr for slag grinding and more than 400t/hr for less finely ground products, while the Dankuni mill will have a capaci", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21493-ultratech-cement-hires-loesche-for-two-clinker-and-slag-grinding-plants", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "asia_cement-2026-11-16-010", "date": "2026-11-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["asia_cement"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["guidance"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -1.0, "keywords": ["decline"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "South Korean cement demand to stay below 40Mt/yr in 2027", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/Cement-bag-truck-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>South Korea:</strong> Domestic cement demand in South Korea will remain below 40Mt/yr in 2027, with the Korea Cement Association forecasting 39.7Mt/yr amid a construction downturn. Demand fell from 50.2Mt/yr in 2023 to 38.3Mt/yr in 2025, with shipments forecast at 38.7Mt/yr in 2026.</p>\n<p>Hanil Cement’s sales fell from US$1.3bn in 2023 to US$1.1bn in 2025, while Asia Cement’s sales declined by 15% ", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21492-south-korean-cement-demand-to-stay-below-40mt-yr-in-2027", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-16-011", "date": "2026-11-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["infrastructure_spending", "raw_material_energy_cost", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Southern Railway opens clinker loading facility in Tamil Nadu", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/india-freight-train.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>India:</strong> Southern Railway has launched a mechanised clinker-loading facility at the Kallakudi Palanganatham railway siding in Tamil Nadu on 12 November 2026. The facility connects Dalmia Cement’s Dalmiapuram plant with Meenatchi Cement Works at Nalli. Maritime Gateway has reported that the facility is expected to handle about 0.7Mt/yr of clinker and generate revenues of US$3.1m/yr.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21490-southern-railway-opens-clinker-loading-facility-in-tamil-nadu", "type": "rss"}]}
